---
// Section 01: Come.
// Purpose: Visitors arrive inside silence. Minimal opening, no explanation, only curiosity.
---

<section 
  id="come" 
  class="relative min-h-[90vh] lg:min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-12 py-16 sm:py-24 border-b border-brand-border/60 overflow-hidden"
>
  <!-- Background Subtle Grid Lines -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#141414_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#141414_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:4rem_4rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_50%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)] opacity-30 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Top Metadata Indicator -->
  <div class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400">
    <span class="tracking-widest uppercase text-[11px] font-medium">Chapter 01 &bull; Entrance</span>
    <span class="hidden sm:inline-block tracking-widest text-[11px]">Kozhikode &bull; Kerala</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Central Editorial Statement -->
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto my-auto py-12 text-center sm:text-left">
    
    <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white"></span>
      <span>A Branding Practice</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Monumental Editorial Typography -->
    <h1 class="font-serif italic font-normal text-white text-editorial-hero leading-[0.92] tracking-tight mb-8">
      Branding begins in <span class="not-italic text-neutral-400 font-sans font-light">observation</span>.
    </h1>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-end pt-6">
      <p class="md:col-span-8 font-sans font-light text-lg sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        Close Communications is not a digital agency. It is a quiet branding practice that believes enduring identity begins with observation, learning, conversation, and thoughtful communication.
      </p>

      <div class="md:col-span-4 flex justify-start md:justify-end">
        <a 
          href="#philosophy" 
          class="group inline-flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors"
        >
          <span>Step Inside</span>
          <span class="transform transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-y-1">↓</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Quiet Motto -->
  <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 pt-8 border-t border-brand-border/40 gap-2">
    <div>
      <span class="text-white">CLOSE</span> IS OPEN.
    </div>
    <div class="text-[11px] text-neutral-400">
      Designed like an architectural gallery, not a sales funnel.
    </div>
  </div>

</section>
